<h2>Measure in Halves and Fourths of an Inch</h2><p>Original 2021 warm-up: compare rulers marked in half inches and quarter inches separately to a NEW combined ruler, checking where ZERO is. The original blackline master is not reproduced.</p>
<h3>Kiran and Jada: BOTH are correct</h3><p>Kiran names the worm length <strong>4 2/4 inches</strong>; Jada names it <strong>4 1/2 inches</strong>. Both represent 4 1/2 inches; 2/4=1/2.</p>
