<h3>Measure and Describe: class activity</h3>
<p>With the combined half and quarter ruler, measure at least <strong>one object with whole-number length</strong> and <strong>three with non-whole-number lengths</strong> (four actual objects minimum). Then <strong>trade lists with another group</strong> and find an object length that can be recorded with an equivalent fraction. Teacher reviews actual measurements, no fixed answers.</p>
